SOAPBOX: Before the competition started, I had a big failure with my main radio, so I couldn't participate in the LOW Power category. I ended up using my emergency RTX, the Xiegu G90. With a makeshift antenna, I couldn't go above 4-5 W, so I tried the QRP category. Another really cool thing is that I got to test my app, WYA PortaLog, in contest mode, which I’ll be releasing soon, and it worked perfectly.
